    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ABSEGAMI HIGH SCHOOL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Absegami High School is mentioned as one of the schools that Cedar Creek High School was intended to alleviate overcrowding for."</data>
